{"id": "22-1006-2-2", "zh": "rāja 等词与 yuva 等词词群", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1007-2-19", "zh": "132. Rājādiyuvādīhā〔ka.189；rū.113；nī.390-1〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1008-2-9", "zh": "在 rāja 等词和 yuva 等词之后，si 变为 ā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1009-2-4", "zh": "rājā gacchati（国王走去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1010-2-19", "zh": "133. Yonamāno〔ka.190；rū.114；nī.392〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1011-2-9", "zh": "在 rāja 等词和 yuva 等词之后，yo 可以变为 āno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1012-2-3", "zh": "rājāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1013-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1013-5-8", "zh": "例如 caturo ca mahārājā（以及四大天王）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1014-2-10", "zh": "bho rāja、bho rājā、bhonto rājāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1015-2-19", "zh": "134. Vaṃmhānaṅa〔ka.188；rū.115；nī.393〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1016-2-8", "zh": "在 aṃ 之前，rāja 等词和 yuva 等词可以加上 ānaṅa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1017-2-18", "zh": "rājānaṃ、rājaṃ、rājāno、caturo ca mahārāje（以及四大天王）〔pe.va.11〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1018-2-26", "zh": "135. Nāsmāsu raññā〔ka.137、270；rū.116、120；nī.316、542〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1019-2-9", "zh": "在 nā 和 smā 之前，rāja 可以变为 raññā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1020-2-5", "zh": "raññā、rājena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1021-2-12", "zh": "136. Rājassi nāmhi〔nī.316〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1022-2-6", "zh": "在 nā 之前，rāja 的词尾变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1023-2-3", "zh": "rājinā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1024-2-19", "zh": "137. Sunaṃhisvu〔ka.169；rū.117；nī.357〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1025-2-11", "zh": "在 su、naṃ、hi 之前，rāja 的词尾可以变为 u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1026-2-9", "zh": "rājūhi、rājūbhi、rājehi、rājebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1027-2-20", "zh": "138. Raññoraññassarājino se〔ka.139；rū.118；nī.314〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1028-2-12", "zh": "在 sa 之前，rāja 连同格尾可以变为 rañño、raññassa、rājino。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1029-2-7", "zh": "rañño、raññassa、rājino。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1030-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1030-5-6", "zh": "例如 rājassa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1031-2-5", "zh": "rājūnaṃ、rājānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1032-2-20", "zh": "139. Rājassa raññaṃ〔ka.136；rū.119；nī.315〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1033-2-7", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，rāja 可以变为 raññaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1034-2-32", "zh": "raññaṃ、rājasmā、rājamhā、raññā、rājūhi、rājūbhi、rājehi、rājebhi、rañño、raññassa、rājino，也可以是 rājassa，rājūnaṃ、rājānaṃ、raññaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1035-2-20", "zh": "140. Smiṃmhi raññerājini〔ka.138；rū.121；nī.317〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1036-2-10", "zh": "在 smiṃ 之前，rāja 连同格尾可以变为 raññe、rājini。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1037-2-13", "zh": "raññe、rājini、rājasmiṃ、rājamhi、rājūsu、rājesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1038-2-7", "zh": "141. Samāse vā（在复合词中可选）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1039-2-8", "zh": "在复合词中，上述所有替换都是可选的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1040-2-77", "zh": "cattāro mahārājā（四大天王）〔dī.ni.2.336〕、cattāro mahārājāno〔a.ni.3.37〕、devarājānaṃ、devarājaṃ、devarājāno、devarāje、caturo ca mahārāje、maṇimhi passa nimmitaṃ（请看宝珠中化现的影像）〔jā.2.22.1394〕、kāsiraññā、kāsirājena、devarājūhi、devarājehi、kāsirañño、kāsirājassa、devarājūnaṃ、devarājānaṃ……乃至……kāsiraññe、kāsirāje、devarājūsu、devarājesu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1041-2-120", "zh": "依据广义规则（mahāvutti），在 rāja 之后 yo 变为 ino，例如巴利圣典中的这些词句：“samantapāsādikā nāma, soḷasāsiṃsu rājino（名为普端严的十六位国王）”、“ekūnatiṃse kappamhi, ito soḷasarājino（从此往前第二十九劫，有十六位国王）”〔apa.thera 1.12.54-55（作 ekūnatiṃsakappamhi, ito soḷasarājāno）〕、“kusarājaṃ mahabbalaṃ（大力的俱舍王）”〔jā.2.20.67〕、“sālarājaṃva pupphitaṃ（如同盛开的娑罗树王）”〔apa.thera 1.42.86〕、“uḷurājaṃva sobhitaṃ（如同光辉的月亮）”、“caturo ca mahārāje（以及四大天王）”〔pe.va.11〕、“yudhañcayo anuññāto, sabbadattena rājinā（瑜丹阇耶得到萨婆达多王的许可）”〔jā.1.11.81〕、“tadā adāsi maṃ tāto, bimbisārassa rājino（那时父亲把我嫁给频毗娑罗王）”〔apa.therī.2.2.326〕、“nikkhamante mahārāje, pathavī sampakampatha（大王出行时，大地为之震动）”等等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-1042-2-11", "zh": "brahmā、brahmāno、bho brahma、bho brahmā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1042-12-30", "zh": "依“Ghabrahmāditve”这条规则，ga 变为 e：bho brahme、bhonto brahmāno、brahmānaṃ、brahmaṃ、brahmāno。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1043-2-19", "zh": "142. Nāmhi〔ka.198；rū.123；nī.410〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1044-2-6", "zh": "在 nā 之前，brahma 的词尾可以变为 u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1045-2-9", "zh": "brahmunā、brahmena、brahmehi、brahmebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1046-2-20", "zh": "143. Brahmassu vā〔ka.198；rū.123；nī.410〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1047-2-9", "zh": "在 sa 和 naṃ 之前，brahma 的词尾可以变为 u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1048-2-21", "zh": "144. Jhalā sassa no〔ka.117；rū.124；nī.292〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1049-2-8", "zh": "在 jha 和 la 之后，sa 变为 no。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1050-2-9", "zh": "brahmuno、brahmassa、brahmūnaṃ、brahmānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1051-2-23", "zh": "145. Smā nāva brahmā ca〔ka.270；rū.120；nī.542〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1052-2-13", "zh": "在 attā、ātuma 以及 brahma 之后，smā 的变化形式与 nā 相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1053-2-15", "zh": "brahmunā、brahmasmā、brahmamhā、brahmuno、brahmassa、brahmūnaṃ、brahmānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1053-16-34", "zh": "依“Kammādito”这条规则，smiṃ 变为 ni：brahmasmiṃ、brahmamhi、brahmani、brahme、brahmesu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1054-2-20", "zh": "attā、attāno、bho atta、bho attā、bhonto attāno、attānaṃ、attaṃ、attāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1054-21-32", "zh": "依“Nāsseno”这条规则，nā 可以变为 ena：attanā、attena。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1055-2-25", "zh": "146. Suhisvanaka〔ka.211；rū.126；nī.439；多数版本作 suhisunaka〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1056-2-11", "zh": "在 su 和 hi 之前，attā 和 ātuma 的词尾加上 anaka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1057-2-9", "zh": "attanehi、attanebhi、attehi、attebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1058-2-19", "zh": "147. Nottātumā〔ka.213；rū.127；nī.440〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1059-2-8", "zh": "在 attā 和 ātuma 之后，sa 变为 no。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1060-2-41", "zh": "attano、attassa、attānaṃ、attasmā、attamhā、attā、attanā、attanehi、attanebhi、attehi、attebhi、attano、attassa、attānaṃ、attasmiṃ、attamhi、attani、atte、attesu、attanesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1061-2-49", "zh": "但在复合词中，它的变化形式与 purisa 等词相同，例如“pahito attā etenāti pahitatto”（自我由此人策励，所以称为 pahitatto，即精勤者）：pahitattā、pahitattaṃ、pahitatte、pahitattena、pahitattehi、pahitattebhi、pahitattassa、pahitattānaṃ、pahitattasmā、pahitattamhā、pahitattā、pahitattehi、pahitattebhi、pahitattassa、pahitattānaṃ、pahitattasmiṃ、pahitattamhi、pahitatte、pahitattesu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1062-2-27", "zh": "ātumā、ātumāno、ātumānaṃ、ātumaṃ、ātumāno、ātumanā、ātumena、ātumanehi、ātumanebhi、ātumano、ātumassa、ātumānaṃ 等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1063-2-4", "zh": "sakhā tiṭṭhati（朋友站着）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1064-2-22", "zh": "148. Āyo no ca sakhā〔ka.191；rū.130；nī.394〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1065-2-12", "zh": "在 sakha 之后，yo 可以变为 āyo 和 no，也可以变为 āno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1066-2-5", "zh": "sakhāno、sakhāyo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1067-2-19", "zh": "149. Nonāsesvi〔ka.194；rū.131；nī.407〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1068-2-11", "zh": "在 no、nā、sa 之前，sakha 的词尾可以变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1069-2-3", "zh": "sakhino。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1070-2-26", "zh": "通过拆分规则（suttavibhatta），在词缀 tta 之前词尾也变为 i，巴利圣典中有“sakhittaṃ kareyya, sakhittaṃ na kareyyā（应当结交友谊，不应当结交友谊）”〔theragā.1017（作 sakhitaṃ）〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1071-2-24", "zh": "150. Yosvaṃhismānaṃsvāraṅa〔ka.195-6；rū.133-4；nī.408-9；多数版本作 yosvaṃhisucāraṅa〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1072-2-13", "zh": "在 yo、aṃ、hi、smā、naṃ 之前，sakha 的词尾变为 āraṅa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1072-14-27", "zh": "依“Ṭoṭe vā”这条规则，在替换为 āra 之后，yo 依次变为 ṭo 和 ṭe。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1073-2-4", "zh": "sakhāro tiṭṭhanti（朋友们站着）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1073-5-36", "zh": "依“Ghabrahmāditve”这条规则，ga 可以变为 e：bho sakha、bho sakhā、bho sakhe，例如“hare sakhā kissa maṃ jahāsi（喂，朋友，你为什么抛下我）”〔jā.1.6.94〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1074-2-15", "zh": "释文（vutti）中说：“sakhi 和 sakhī 两种形式用于阴性。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1075-2-52", "zh": "bhonto sakhāno、bhonto sakhāyo、bhonto sakhino、bhonto sakhāro、sakhānaṃ、sakhāraṃ、sakhaṃ、sakhāno、sakhāyo、sakhino、sakhāre、sakhāro、sakhinā、sakhārena、sakhena、sakhārehi、sakhārebhi、sakhehi、sakhebhi、sakhissa、sakhino、sakhārānaṃ、sakhānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1076-2-26", "zh": "151. Smānaṃsu vā〔ka.194、170；rū.120、131；nī.407、542〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1077-2-9", "zh": "在 smā 和 naṃ 之前，sakha 的词尾可以变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1078-2-35", "zh": "sakhīnaṃ、sakhismā、sakhimhā、sakhā、sakhinā、sakhārasmā、sakhāramhā、sakhārā、sakhārehi、sakhārebhi、sakhehi、sakhebhi、sakhissa、sakhino、sakhārānaṃ、sakhānaṃ、sakhīnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
